    "text": "county17.com\nwebsite\nCampbell County, Wyoming\nCampbell County School Board reviews policy updates, celebrates heroism at Wright meeting\nBy Raveena Devjee,\n10 hours agoGILLETTE, Wyo. — The Campbell County School District Board of Trustees met Tuesday evening at Wright Junior Senior High School, where members approved a series of administrative actions, recognized staff and student achievements and discussed potential changes to policies on cellphones and artificial intelligence in classrooms. Board Chair Lisa Durgin presided over the meeting, which drew attention to both student progress and ongoing facility improvements across the district.",
